#!author=Ezrea7[https://github.com/Ezrea7]
#!tag=去广告
#!basedOn=iOS
#!qx_version=1.5.2-854
#!homepage=https://github.com/Ezrea7/R-Store/tree/main/Rule/QuanX/README.md
